$ are parallel to this plane. Therefore, a parametric equation for the plane can be written as\n\n$$\nR(s,u)=r(0)+s\\,T(0)+u\\,N(0),\\,s,u\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\n \n\nWe have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(0) & =⟨0,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡0-\\operatorname{sin}⁡0,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡0+\\operatorname{sin}⁡0⟩=⟨0,1,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, a parametric equation for the osculating plane at the point $(0,1,1)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R(s,u) & =r(0)+s\\,T(0)+u\\,N(0) \\\\  & =⟨0,1,1⟩+s\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}⟨-1,-1,1⟩+u\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟨0,-1,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\,1-\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3}-\\frac{u\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\,1+\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3}-\\frac{u\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375833 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375834 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375835 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375836 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375837 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375834 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375832 1080 #uuid "187786e6-deb0-5d64-8f2a-517c86ffee30" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375833 1081 "R(s,u)=⟨\\sqrt{3},\\,(s-u)\\sqrt{3},\\,(s+u)\\sqrt{3}⟩" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375833 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375833 1084 #uuid "38c1e0ab-2828-5e9c-9df8-5e2c181ea0fb" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375834 1081 "R(s,u)=⟨-\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\,1-\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3}-\\frac{u\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\,1+\\frac{s\\sqrt{3}}{3}-\\frac{u\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟩" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [