0)\\times N(0)=k=⟨0,0,1⟩.\n$$\n\nFinally, let $⟨x,y,z⟩$ denote the position vector of a general point on the osculating plane. Since the plane is perpendicular to $n$ and passes through the tip of the position vector $p$, its Cartesian equation can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(⟨x,y,z⟩-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,1⟩ & =⟨0,1,3⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,1⟩ \\\\ x(0)+y(0)+z(1) & =0(0)+1(0)+3(1) \\\\ 0+0+z & =0+0+3 \\\\ z-3 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375854 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375855 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375856 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375857 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375858 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375857 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375853 1080 #uuid "71cc03d2-9231-5fa8-91b2-49256a0521c7" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375854 1081 "y+z-4=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375854 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375854 1084 #uuid "44cd799c-5a5d-585f-92be-d8c29583a039" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375855 1081 "y-1=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375855 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375855 1084 #uuid "8b3a7022-55b8-5476-84be-a682dc7a0571" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375856 1081 "x=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375856 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375856 1084 #uuid "acd33e7d-5619-59af-86e7-f13552b