 $⟨x,y,z⟩$ denote the position vector of a general point on the osculating plane. Since the plane is perpendicular to $n$ and passes through the tip of the position vector $p$, its Cartesian equation can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(⟨x,y,z⟩-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨0,1,0⟩ & =⟨0,1,2⟩\\cdot ⟨0,1,0⟩ \\\\ x(0)+y(1)+z(0) & =0(0)+1(1)+2(0) \\\\ 0+y+0 & =0+1+0 \\\\ y-1 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375861 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375862 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375863 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375864 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375865 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375861 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375860 1080 #uuid "38507475-0514-5b9b-b6cc-a25300e0334e" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375861 1081 "y-1=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375861 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375861 1084 #uuid "7cce7a57-ec50-5b7d-a10d-d12d340f7ebd" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375862 1081 "z-2=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375862 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375862 1084 #uuid "0dd603f8-dae9-5232-88ef-942f6c34a5d2" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375863 1081 "y+z-2=0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375863 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375863 1084 #uuid "e673e372-7f75-50af-8159-f2472454cfed" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] 