\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that ${C}^{2}=C,$ so $C$ is an idempotent matrix.  \n\nWe can use this fact to compute ${C}^{4}$ quickly, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{4} & ={C}^{2}\\cdot {C}^{2} \\\\  & =C\\cdot C \\\\  & ={C}^{2} \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{C}^{4}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375924 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375925 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375926 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375927 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375928 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375925 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375923 1080 #uuid "730549d1-5dd7-5d03-a4f9-dc98698c3514" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375924 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375924 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375924 1084 #uuid "b3033aa1-cb1b-51d7-bd66-84b07ac416e0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375925 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375925 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375925 1084 #uuid "0864e58a-33de-52c4-a01e-09b896904513" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375926 108