e:\n\n$$\nκ(t)=\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the magnitudes of ${r}^{′}(t)$ and ${T}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}+{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2} \\\\  & =1 \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}})}^{2}+{(-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{e}^{2t}}+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t}{{e}^{2t}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{e}^{t}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{{e}^{t}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{{e}^{t}})} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{t}}{\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375931 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375932 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375933 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375934 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375935 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375931 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375930 1080 #uuid "4d564c3b-bc44-52