gned}{r}^{′}(s) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟨1,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡s,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡s⟩ \\\\ {r}^{″}(s) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡s)⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}⟨0,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡s,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡s⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(s) & =‖{r}^{″}(s)‖ \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(\\operatorname{cos}⁡s)^{2}+(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{{cos}^{2}⁡s+{sin}^{2}⁡s} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375945 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375946 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375947 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375948 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375949 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375949 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375944 1080 #uuid "99286ab1-0529-592a-a01e-9213d9a85af3" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375945 1081 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375945 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375945 1084 #uuid "4c029dea-a78b-581a-8bd5-44c28d695ef6" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375946 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375946 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375946 1084 #uuid "5dc03ce3-dcb4-5138-85e0-9ac90f62e937" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375947 1081 "2" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375947 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375947 1084 #uuid "2d586d80-2104-5609-95be-63300d4f541c" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375948 1081 "1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375948 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375948 1084 #uuid "89c05da2-ed4c-5795-b2e7-630412b0a573" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375949 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375949 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375949 1084 #uuid "0da20f0e-5794-567a-8a0a-852e4acd4097" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1068 #edb/ref 17592186375951 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1069 "q-139986" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1071 "Which of the following statements are true, given that $A$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix and \n\n$$\n\\text{Null}(A)=\\text{Span}{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}?\n$$\n\n- The number of non-pivot columns in $A$ is equal to $3$\n- $\\text{Col}(A)={R}^{4}$\n- $\\text{rank}(A)=3$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1072 #uuid "8048be79-9af8-51c0-a0c1-5b68f549139c" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375950 1074 "Since $A$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix, the invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$A$ is invertible $\\,⇔\\,{\\,\\begin{aligned} & \\text{Col}(A)={R}^{4} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Col}(A))=4=\\text{rank}(A) \\\\  & \\text{Null}(A)={0} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Null}(A))=0=\\text{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}$\n\nAlso, according to the rank-nullity theorem, if $A$ is a matrix with $n$ columns, then \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Since the generating vectors in \n\n$$\n\\text{Null}(A)=\\text{Span}{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nare linearly independent, we conclude that the number of non-pivot columns in $A$ is equal to $1.$\n\n- Statement II is false. Since $\\text{nullity}(A)=1\\ne 0,$ then by the invertible matrix theorem, we have $\\text{Col}(A)\\ne {R}^{4}.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, for the matrix $A,$ the number of columns is $n=4.$ Now, according to the rank-nullity theorem, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A) & =n \\\\ \\text{rank}(A)+1 & =4 \\\\ \\text{rank}(A) & =4-1 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375952 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375953 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375954 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375955 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375956 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375954 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375951 1080 #uuid "5fcf0b75-42a2-57a9-b53b-de57c7f819c7" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375952 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375952 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375952 1084 #uuid "382969c5-f931-58f2-b34f-f69c2b1c521c" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375953 1081 "I only" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375953 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 131941395334