92786f0d9bf8d9e0e258cdd15f041afba4.png)\n\nConsider the graph of the function $f(x),$ shown above. It consists of a line segment and an arc of a semi-circle centered at $(4,0)$ with radius $1.$ Find the value of \n${\\int }_{-1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375985 1072 #uuid "4600d16d-6c96-5d04-80e6-8eca78510bd9" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375985 1074 "The graph consists of $2$ parts: the line segment for $x\\in [-1,3]$ and the arc of a semi-circle for $x\\in [3,5].$ Therefore, we can write the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={{{\\int }_{-1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{1}}+{{{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{2}}\n$$\n\nThe $1$st integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [-1,3].$ The corresponding region is a trapezoid, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{2}(a+b)h \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(1+4)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $2$nd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [3,5].$ The corresponding region is a semi-circle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\pi \\cdot {1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}+{A}_{2} \\\\  & =5+\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375987 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375988 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375989 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375990 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375991 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375991 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375986 1080 #uuid "d5eb3575-092a-56fe-a57b-60125786a215" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375987 1081 "\\frac{5}{2}\\pi " 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375987 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375987 1084 #uuid "7419bfed-a2af-55fa-8052-9352fd0bced0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375988 1081 "5+\\pi " 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375988 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375988 1084 #uuid "987b00a1-c223-5380-8f96-007de6ba9f86" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375989 1081 "5+\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375989 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375989 1084 #uuid "8cb0d65d-25f4-5e04-9817-b8718b99cd38" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375990 1081 "2+\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375990 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375990 1084 #uuid "b9203aac-49c8-5228-bfbf-a3f92c253b34" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375991 1081 "5+\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375991 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375991 1084 #uuid "f369676f-91b1-5fcc-a14a-9c0e76b74d8e" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1068 #edb/ref 17592186375993 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1069 "q-14743" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1071 "Calculate the integral $\\int (5{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1072 #uuid "a3ba8f8e-9db5-5eee-b179-738a991a847a" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375992 1074 "We need to use integration by parts. \n\nIn this case, we define\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=5{x}^{2}+1\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=10x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 5{x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(5{x}^{2}+1)(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)(10x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-(5{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we use integration by parts to evaluate  $\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$ We take\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the formula for integration by parts gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(x)(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+D,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is an integral constant.\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-(5{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10(x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+D) \\\\  & =-(5{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+10\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10D \\\\  & =(9-5{x}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=10D.$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375994 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375995 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375996 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375997 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375998 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375997 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375993 1080 #uuid "8da66d60-a755-55c1-b169-746370272077" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375994 1081 "({x}^{2}-6)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375994 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375994 1084 #uuid "ad8beeca-1e54-5b45-a409-62c86b43b0a6" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375995 1081 "(1-4{x}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375995 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375995 1084 #uuid "c8c5975c-637f-518f-a11f-a839e7ab95b0" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375996 1081 "(5{x}^{2}+11)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375996 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375996 1084 #uuid "605cd892-ccce-5cb2-8d94-edad1275c811" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375997 1081 "(9-5{x}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186375997 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 1759218