rcle for $x\\in [0,1]$, the line segment for  $x\\in [1,3]$, and  the arc of a quarter-circle for $x\\in [3,6].$ Therefore, we can write the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={{{\\int }_{-2}^{0}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{-{A}_{1}}+{{{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{-{A}_{2}}+{{{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{3}}+{{{\\int }_{3}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{4}}\n$$\n\nThe $1$st integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [-2,0].$ The corresponding region is a right triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-2}^{0}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{1}=-1.\n$$\n\nThe $2$nd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [0,1].$ The corresponding region is a quarter-circle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{4}\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\pi \\cdot {1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{2}=-\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\n$$\n\nThe $3$rd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [1,3].$ The corresponding region is a right triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $4$th integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [3,6].$ The corresponding region is a quarter-circle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{4} & =\\frac{1}{4}\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\pi \\cdot {3}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-{A}_{1}-{A}_{2}+{A}_{3}+{A}_{4} \\\\  & =-1-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+3+\\frac{9\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =2+2\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376008 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376009 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376010 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376011 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376012 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1079 #edb/ref 17592186376010 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376007 1080 #uuid "f9567c7d-c882-5493-a6d3-a199ce93f839" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376008 1081 "\\frac{7}{2}+2\\pi " 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376008 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376008 1084 #uuid "1ee44ca8-aeba-5390-b2e6-351810b88c0d" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376009 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}+\\pi " 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376009 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376009 1084 #uuid "4acb367e-9e8b-514d-ab46-5986a827f3b9" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376010 1081 "2+2\\pi " 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376010 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376010 1084 #uuid "edae3abb-a831-54c6-8eeb-1a37c2dd5097" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376011 1081 "\\frac{5}{2}+\\frac{5\\pi }{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376011 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376011 1084 #uuid "ba222052-c3c8-55d3-91b4-a44f89be583d" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376012 1081 "\\frac{