te the area ${A}_{1}$ of the trapezoid as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4\\cdot (1+2) \\\\  & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To find the second integral where $x\\in [0,1],$ we compute the area ${A}_{2}$ of the rectangle as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{2} & =1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(1)={\\int }_{-4}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}+{A}_{2}=6+2=8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376036 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376037 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376038 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376039 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376040 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1079 #edb/ref 17592186376038 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376035 1080 #uuid "10d0807a-2d70-5f5a-a226-1c7e5c987a18" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376036 1081 "9" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376036 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376036 1084 #uuid "b3486c54-da95-531b-8b53-26b12acef4be" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376037 1081 "10" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376037 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376037 1084 #uuid "ec0d466f-06cc-5399-aa49-83f879252fed" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376038 1081 "8" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376038 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376038 1084 #uuid "4f872bc9-6bfc-5fc9-89e0-cfae2c57617d" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376039 1081 "\\frac