]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, $[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ does not belong to $Π$ since \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z & =2 \\\\ 2(0)-(-2)+(2) & =2 \\\\ 4 & =2\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since $0\\notin Π,$ this set is not closed under scalar multiplication.\n\n- Statement IV is false. Since statements II and III are false, $L$ is *not* a subspace of ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the statements are true.\"" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376069 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376070 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376071 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376072 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186376073 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1079 #edb/ref 17592186376069 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376068 1080 #uuid "8792e5eb-7851-5eb1-bea8-450df1d7ff21" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376069 1081 "None of the statements are true" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376069 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376069 1084 #uuid "3ac94ad9-5677-542c-a1a4-43980ccb8be1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376070 1081 "II and IV only" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376070 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376070 1084 #uuid "91fd0b1e-93fc-5eec-9727-963c18b4b58a" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376071 1081 "I only" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186376071 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [1759