7592186045585 true] [17592186377171 1071 "Consider the following initial value problem:\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=3x\\sqrt{y},\\,y(1)=1\n$$\n\nUsing the trapezoidal method with step size $Δx=1,$ the new value ${y}_{\\text{new}}$ is obtained by solving the equation $g({y}_{\\text{new}})=0$ at each step. Which of the following is the **specific function** $g({y}_{\\text{new}})$ used in the first step?" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377171 1072 #uuid "b37ab3c3-9716-5054-bac9-1caa7318af92" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377171 1074 "For an initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=f(x,y),\\,y(a)=c,\n$$\n\nthe trapezoidal method with step size $Δx$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔy=\\frac{1}{2}({y}^{′}+{y}_{\\text{new}}^{′})\\cdot Δx,\n$$\n\nwith ${y}_{\\text{new}}^{′}=f({x}_{\\text{new}},{y}_{\\text{new}})$ evaluated at the next $x$ and $y$ values.\n\nIn this example, $Δy$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δy & =\\frac{1}{2}({y}^{′}+{y}_{\\text{new}}^{′})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(3x\\sqrt{y}+3{x}_{\\text{new}}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}})\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}x\\sqrt{y}+\\frac{3}{2}{x}_{\\text{new}}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into ${y}_{\\text{new}}=y+Δy,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+Δy \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+\\frac{3}{2}x\\sqrt{y}+\\frac{3}{2}{x}_{\\text{new}}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand moving all terms to the left-hand side gives the equation\n\n$$\n{y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{3}{2}{x}_{\\text{new}}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-y-\\frac{3}{2}x\\sqrt{y}=0.\n$$\n\nSo, the general form of the function $g$ for step size $Δx=1$ is\n\n$$\ng({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{3}{2}{x}_{\\text{new}}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-y-\\frac{3}{2}x\\sqrt{y}.\n$$\n\nNow, in the first step, the new $x$ value is\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{new}}=x+Δx=1+1=2,\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function used in the first step is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g({y}_{\\text{new}}) & ={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{3}{2}(2)\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-1-\\frac{3}{2}(1)\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & ={y}_{\\text{new}}-3\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377173 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377174 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377175 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377176 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377177 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377173 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377172 1080 #uuid "73c9ddf8-80ca-566d-bab4-64466789b626" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377173 1081 "g({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-3\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377173 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377173 1084 #uuid "9fdb87f7-ccac-507f-8836-bc8d7f102dba" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377174 1081 "g({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-3\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377174 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377174 1084 #uuid "392932df-d404-5453-bb3d-afe9173ef29f" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377175 1081 "g({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-3\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-2" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377175 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377175 1084 #uuid "16946660-0e3c-5d60-acd8-815d2a65a946" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377176 1081 "g({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533452 1759