 {z}^{′} & =-x{z}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve the obtained equation using separation of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =-x{z}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{{z}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =-x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{{z}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int -x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {z}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int -x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -\\frac{1}{z} & =-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\ z & =\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+C}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\n\nFinally, let's substitute $z=y-x$ to recover the initial variable $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+C} \\\\ y-x & =\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+C} \\\\ y & =x+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+C}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377180 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377181 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377182 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377183 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377184 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377184 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377179 1080 #uuid "97437db8-7e70-5514-8992-0417e03eae5a" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377180 1081 "y=x+\\frac{2}{2{x}^{2}+C}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377180 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377180 1084 #uuid "0c806c89-002d-5f26-82c5-3688e7185315" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377181 1081 "y=x+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377181 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377181 1084 #uuid "5d93d1be-2ba0-5b10-9818-3933954d8