{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)-\\frac{10}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0) \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377546 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377545 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377545 1077 "field-1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377545 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377546 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377545 1080 #uuid "8d0f7cff-e86b-56b3-9a00-cbb02d98343e" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377546 1081 "\\frac{5\\pi }{6}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377546 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377546 1084 #uuid "d90c6aca-5f52-581d-b9b7-53525c39db0b" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1068 #edb/ref 17592186377548 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1068 #edb/ref 17592186377550 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1068 #edb/ref 17592186377552 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1069 "q-351913" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1071 "Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial ${P}_{2}(x)$ of $f(x)=\\frac{1}{1-2x}$ about $x=0.$\n\n${P}_{2}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}$\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\,x\\,+$\n{{field-3}}$\\,{x}^{2}$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1072 #uuid "62e4303f-1bcc-5986-b711-5a5ffaca681d" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377547 1074 "To find the second-degree Taylor polynomial about $x=0,$ we plug $a=0$ into the general formula to give\n\n$$\n{P}_{2}(x)=f(0)+{f}^{′}(0)(x-0)+\\frac{1}{2}{f}^{″}(0)(x-0)^{2}.\n$$\n\nSo, we need to work out $f(0),$ ${f}^{′}(0),$ and ${f}^{″}(0):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{1}{1-2