}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)$ into our second-degree Taylor polynomial. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{2}(x) & =9+18(x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)+36\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{(x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}^{2} \\\\  & =9+18(x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)+18{(x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377555 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377556 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377555 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377555 1077 "field-1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377555 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377556 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377555 1080 #uuid "6cd4c2e8-f4ea-59cd-a7aa-2b954072bd85" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377556 1081 "9" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377556 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377556 1084 #uuid "608ccf0e-06c8-583a-a426-ff86893191a7" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377558 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377557 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377557 1077 "field-2" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377557 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377558 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377557 1080 #uuid "8df04968-76e1-52c2-910e-3ae80eed1d09" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377558 1081 "18" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377558 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377558 1084 #uuid "8d356ef5-8297-5b20-a0d7-9a9701f4028b" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377559 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377560 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377559 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377559 1077 "field-3" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377559 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377560 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377559 1080 #uuid "fc5e0105-6833-5c05-ae89-a4