 & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{3}=-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-{A}_{1}+{A}_{2}-{A}_{3} \\\\  & =-1+2-2 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377616 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377617 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377618 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377619 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377620 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377619 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377615 1080 #uuid "1f10afe1-936d-561e-880b-8313e7bf8012" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377616 1081 "2" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377616 1084 #uuid "4c2f25a4-79fe-556d-ae25-a194f519da74" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377617 1081 "1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377617 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377617 1084 #uuid "27865a4b-9639-5cad-8e86-31e331f1b620" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377618 1081 "-3" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377618 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377618 1084 #uuid "b0046ef8-6a75-5d7f-abd4-d0175e54c8e5" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377619 1081 "-1" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377619 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585