070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377871 1071 "Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- **If** $2$ is an even number, **then** $8$ is a prime number.\n- **If** $8$ is an even number, **then** $2$ is an even number.\n- **If** $8$ is a prime number, **then** $2$ is an even number." 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377871 1072 #uuid "28c545f7-d207-5c17-a488-3a5f17bee359" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377871 1074 "An implication $A⇒B$ is true *unless* $A$ is true and $B$ is false. In other words, the implication is true unless the \"promise\" is broken.\n\n- Statement I is false. The antecedent \"$2$ is an even number\" is true, and the consequent \"$8$ is a prime number\" is false. So the promise is broken, and the statement is false.\n\n- Statement II is true. The antecedent \"$8$ is an even number\" is true, and the consequent \"$2$ is an even number\" is true. So the promise is kept, and the statement is true.\n\n- Statement III is true. The antecedent \"$8$ is a prime number\" is false, so the promise does not apply. Regardless of the consequent, the promise is *not* broken, and the statement is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377873 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377874 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377875 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377876 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186377877 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1079 #edb/ref 17592186377873 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186377872 1080 #uuid "88539d75-c77a-55a8-9e2f-8812818cf2d1" 1319413953