 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378024 1074 "First, notice that \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\ngives the following expressions for ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} & ={x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2} & ={x}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy solving the second equation for ${x}_{1}$ and substituting it into the first equation, we obtain the following expressions for ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={y}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} & =-{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute these into our quadratic form expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q(x) & ={x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{2}^{2} \\\\  & ={y}_{2}^{2}+2{y}_{2}(-{y}_{1}+{y}_{2})+(-{y}_{1}+{y}_{2})^{2} \\\\  & ={y}_{2}^{2}+-2{y}_{2}{y}_{1}+2{y}_{2}^{2}+{y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{2}{y}_{2}+{y}_{2}^{2} \\\\  & ={y}_{1}^{2}-4{y}_{1}{y}_{2}+4{y}_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378026 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378027 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378028 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378029 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378030 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1079 #edb/ref 17592186378027 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378025 1080 #uuid "4300a56d-5e54-5540-af4a-6073862831d4" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378026 1081 "{y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{1}{y}_{2}+{y}_{2}^{2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378026 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378026 1084 #uuid "