he partial derivatives of $f$ with respect to $x$ and $y:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}},\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=\\frac{2y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s$ and $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{2(t{e}^{s})}{(t{e}^{s})^{2}+(t{e}^{-s})^{2}}=\\frac{2{e}^{s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{2(t{e}^{-s})}{(t{e}^{s})^{2}+(t{e}^{-s})^{2}}=\\frac{2{e}^{-s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x$ and $y$ with respect to $t,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂t} & ={e}^{s}, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂t} & ={e}^{-s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂t} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{∂x}{∂t}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{∂y}{∂t} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{e}^{s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}\\cdot {e}^{s}+\\frac{2{e}^{-s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}\\cdot {e}^{-s} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{e}^{2s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}+\\frac{2{e}^{-2s}}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})}{t({e}^{2s}+{e}^{-2s})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378046 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378047 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378048 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378049 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378050 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1079 #edb/ref 17592186378046 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378045 1080 #uuid "a12f54b9-7bd3-5a99-bf1e-a42a31564b96" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592