\\begin{aligned}v(0)\\times a(0) & =⟨1,\\,1,\\,0⟩\\times ⟨0,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k \\\\  & =⟨1,-1,0⟩, \\\\ ||v(0)|| & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}, \\\\ ||v(0)\\times a(0)|| & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the normal component of the acceleration at $t=0,$ and we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{N} & =\\frac{||v(0)\\times a(0)||}{||v(0)||} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the normal component of acceleration is $1\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}.$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378168 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378169 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378170 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378171 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378172 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1079 #edb/ref 17592186378169 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378167 1080 #uuid "4204dbc9-2498-57c1-9d36-58825b07725e" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378168 1081 "2\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378168 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378168 1084 #uuid "f321d873-66ae-598a-b655-9d65842dd671" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378169 1081 "1\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [175921863781