me{ln}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,0,\\,1⟩, \\\\ a(1) & =⟨-1,\\,0,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $v(1)\\times a(1),||v(1)||,$ and $||v(1)\\times a(1)||:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(1)\\times a(1) & =⟨0,\\,2,\\,1⟩\\times ⟨-1,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k \\\\  & =⟨2,-1,2⟩, \\\\ ||v(1)|| & =\\sqrt{0)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}, \\\\ ||v(1)\\times a(1)|| & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the normal component of the acceleration at $t=1,$ and we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{N} & =\\frac{||v(1)\\times a(1)||}{||v(1)||} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\  & ≈1.3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the normal component of acceleration is approximately \n $1.3\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}.$" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378175 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378176 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378177 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378178 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378179 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1077 "selection" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1079 #edb/ref 17592186378179 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378174 1080 #uuid "e0430af4-731e-55e8-bdd1-d1f06c0deeb5" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true] [17592186378175 1081 "0.8\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533452 17592186045585 true]